    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25310" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμοτ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μότος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put lint into</i> a wound,
			so as to keep it open, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἕλκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VC</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.752
			</span></i>: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμότ-ωσις</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.14.14
			</span></i>, Leonidasap.<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.1
			</span></i>.</div>
